mage/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="Now You Know Who I Am" srcSet="https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000002919/246ba742-51de-407f-bc76-14a2d5940afb.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_384%2Fquality%2Cq_70 1x, https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000002919/246ba742-51de-407f-bc76-14a2d5940afb.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_640%2Fquality%2Cq_70 2x" src="https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000002919/246ba742-51de-407f-bc76-14a2d5940afb.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_640%2Fquality%2Cq_70" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy"/></noscript></span></a></div><div class="min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden md:flex-1 md:p-20px"><div><h2 class="line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/90 font-500 leading-[normal] text-14/vw md:line-clamp-1 md:text-16px md:text-white/80 md:font-400"><a href="/movie/now-you-know-who-i-am-695f17baf52a835e5306ca5c">Now You Know Who I Am</a></h2><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-8px md:text-12px md:hidden"><div class="flex items-center mr-16/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.9" d="M4.488 7.04c.817-4.063 2.618-4.91 6.539-3.218a31.933 31.933 0 0 1 7.617 4.624c3.141 2.58 3.141 4.423 0 7.003a31.936 31.936 0 0 1-7.617 4.624c-3.92 1.692-5.722.845-6.54-3.218a24.93 24.93 0 0 1 0-9.815"></path></svg></span></span>28.5M</div><div class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.053 6.143a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.476-2.476H24.47a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.477 2.476v21.251c0 .98-1.086 1.572-1.91 1.04l-7.695-4.964a2.476 2.476 0 0 0-2.685 0l-7.696 4.965a1.238 1.238 0 0 1-1.91-1.04z"></path></svg></span></span>363.7k</div></div><div class="rich-text inner-html-clamp line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/50 leading-[normal] mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-12px md:text-12px cursor-pointer md:line-clamp-2">Elena is chair of the Cooper Group. She handed the company over to her husband, Dalton. Elena returns to board of directors after a 5-year absence, but no one at the company recognizes her anymore. Elena is met with a workplace full of gossip, bullying, and rumors. Many speculate that "Dalton's wife" is some old hag. Flora, Dalton's secretary, has repeatedly, unsuccessfully tried to seduce him. One day, Flora sees Dalton and Elena sharing affection, and believes Elena to be his mistress. Then, she finds out Elana is pregnant. Wanting to be Dalton's mistress herself, Flora sets her sights on tormenting Elena, and forcing her out of the picture.</div></div><div class="flex justify-between hidden md:flex md:items-end"><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px"><div class="flex items-center mr-24/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" 