ttom-0 left-0 right-0"></div><a class="cursor-pointer"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%"><span style="box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:100%"><img style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:initial;height:initial;background:none;opacity:1;border:0;margin:0;padding:0" alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20version=%271.1%27%20width=%27300%27%20height=%27400%27/%3e"/></span><img alt="The Reckoning Takes Flight" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover"/><noscript><img alt="The Reckoning Takes Flight" srcSet="https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000279/6ffd6b6b-e47c-4500-81ad-afd7fceb6724.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_384%2Fquality%2Cq_70 1x, https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000279/6ffd6b6b-e47c-4500-81ad-afd7fceb6724.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_640%2Fquality%2Cq_70 2x" src="https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000279/6ffd6b6b-e47c-4500-81ad-afd7fceb6724.jpg?x-oss-process=image%2Fresize%2Cw_640%2Fquality%2Cq_70" decoding="async" data-nimg="intrinsic" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;border:none;margin:auto;display:block;width:0;height:0;min-width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover" loading="lazy"/></noscript></span></a></div><div class="min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden md:flex-1 md:p-20px"><div><h2 class="line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/90 font-500 leading-[normal] text-14/vw md:line-clamp-1 md:text-16px md:text-white/80 md:font-400"><a href="/movie/the-reckoning-takes-flight-6858f98983761bd35a005ddd">The Reckoning Takes Flight</a></h2><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-8px md:text-12px md:hidden"><div class="flex items-center mr-16/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.9" d="M4.488 7.04c.817-4.063 2.618-4.91 6.539-3.218a31.933 31.933 0 0 1 7.617 4.624c3.141 2.58 3.141 4.423 0 7.003a31.936 31.936 0 0 1-7.617 4.624c-3.92 1.692-5.722.845-6.54-3.218a24.93 24.93 0 0 1 0-9.815"></path></svg></span></span>125.1M</div><div class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.053 6.143a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.476-2.476H24.47a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.477 2.476v21.251c0 .98-1.086 1.572-1.91 1.04l-7.695-4.964a2.476 2.476 0 0 0-2.685 0l-7.696 4.965a1.238 1.238 0 0 1-1.91-1.04z"></path></svg></span></span>2.9M</div></div><div class="rich-text inner-html-clamp line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/50 leading-[normal] mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-12px md:text-12px cursor-pointer md:line-clamp-2">Eve takes a flight to Hawaii to attend her big brother's wedding, booking an extra-wide seat because of her broken leg in a cast. A nasty woman and her bratty son demand Eve switch seats with them. The kid trips because of turbulence, his mom demands the flight turn back and fights the pilots, forcing an emergency landing. The mom's sister, Clara, shows up to back her up. Clara accuses Eve of being her fiancée's mistress, not realizing that she's her fiancée's little sister. The wedding is canceled, and Clara is sent to jail.</div></div><div class="flex justify-between hidden md:flex md:items-end"><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px"><div class="flex items-center mr-24/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.9" d="M4.488 7.04c.817-4.063 2.618-4.91 6.539-3.218a31.933 31.933 0 0 1 7.617 4.624c3.141 2.58 3.141 4.423 0 7.003a31.936 31.936 0 0 1-7.617 4.624c-3.92 1.692-5.722.845-6.54-3.218a24.93 24.93 0 0 1 0-9.815"></path></svg></span></span>125.1M</div><div class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2/vw text-14/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.053 6.143a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.476-2.476H24.47a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.477 2.476v21.251c0 .98-1.086 1.572-1.91 1.04l-7.695-4.964a2.476 2.476 0 0 0-2.685 0l-7.696 4.965a1.238 1.238 0 0 1-1.91-1.04z"></path></svg></span></span>2.9M</div></div><button role="play_btn" class="flex-center font-bold h-30/vw min-w-107/vw px-10/vw rounded-4/vw text-14/vw transition-colors duration-200 md:px-0 md:h-48px md:w-160px md:min-w-0 md:flex-none md:rounded-32px md:px-0 md:text-16px  bg-white/90 text-black/90 hover:bg-#e52e2e hover:text-white/90 cursor-pointer"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-4px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="tru