-0 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden md:flex-1 md:p-20px"><div><h2 class="line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/90 font-500 leading-[normal] text-14/vw md:line-clamp-1 md:text-16px md:text-white/80 md:font-400"><a href="/movie/i-am-bloody-mary-6825b0364baea997900af476">I Am Bloody Mary</a></h2><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-8px md:text-12px md:hidden"><div class="flex items-center mr-16/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.9" d="M4.488 7.04c.817-4.063 2.618-4.91 6.539-3.218a31.933 31.933 0 0 1 7.617 4.624c3.141 2.58 3.141 4.423 0 7.003a31.936 31.936 0 0 1-7.617 4.624c-3.92 1.692-5.722.845-6.54-3.218a24.93 24.93 0 0 1 0-9.815"></path></svg></span></span>18.2M</div><div class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.053 6.143a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.476-2.476H24.47a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.477 2.476v21.251c0 .98-1.086 1.572-1.91 1.04l-7.695-4.964a2.476 2.476 0 0 0-2.685 0l-7.696 4.965a1.238 1.238 0 0 1-1.91-1.04z"></path></svg></span></span>187.1k</div></div><div class="rich-text inner-html-clamp line-clamp-2 break-words text-white/50 leading-[normal] mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-12px md:text-12px cursor-pointer md:line-clamp-2">In I Am Bloody Mary movie, Mare and her fiancé Nick may not have much money, but they have love. As a foster kid with no family of her own, Mare dreams of a wedding with Nick’s family by their side, but Nick is secretive about his estranged relatives. Then, unexpectedly, his mother arrives, warmly inviting Mare into the wealthy and mysterious Thornwood family. She even offers to host the wedding at their grand estate. But the morning of the ceremony, a horrifying discovery shatters Mare's dream, and she realizes she’s not walking into a happy-ever-after, but into a nightmare twisted by the Thornwood family’s dark history--one that might end up killing her.</div></div><div class="flex justify-between hidden md:flex md:items-end"><div class="flex text-white/50 mt-8/vw text-12/vw md:mt-0 md:text-14px"><div class="flex items-center mr-24/vw md:mr-24px"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.9" d="M4.488 7.04c.817-4.063 2.618-4.91 6.539-3.218a31.933 31.933 0 0 1 7.617 4.624c3.141 2.58 3.141 4.423 0 7.003a31.936 31.936 0 0 1-7.617 4.624c-3.92 1.692-5.722.845-6.54-3.218a24.93 24.93 0 0 1 0-9.815"></path></svg></span></span>18.2M</div><div class="flex items-center"><span class="mr-2/vw text-14/vw md:mr-2px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="anticon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.053 6.143a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.476-2.476H24.47a2.476 2.476 0 0 1 2.477 2.476v21.251c0 .98-1.086 1.572-1.91 1.04l-7.695-4.964a2.476 2.476 0 0 0-2.685 0l-7.696 4.965a1.238 1.238 0 0 1-1.91-1.04z"></path></svg></span></span>187.1k</div></div><button role="play_btn" class="flex-center font-bold h-30/vw min-w-107/vw px-10/vw rounded-4/vw text-14/vw transition-colors duration-200 md:px-0 md:h-48px md:w-160px md:min-w-0 md:flex-none md:rounded-32px md:px-0 md:text-16px  bg-white/90 text-black/90 hover:bg-#e52e2e hover:text-white/90 cursor-pointer"><span class="mr-2/vw text-12/vw md:mr-4px md:text-16px"><span role="img" class="antic