rs: Monday to Sunday, 12am to 8am(ET)</p></div></div><div class="Footer_footer_item__Jzv7v"><div class="Footer_item_title__7csub">SUPPORT</div><div class="Footer_item_sub_title__VYtUB"><span rel="nofollow" class="Footer_item_sub_text__EQ_F8">Feedback</span></div><div class="Footer_item_sub_title__VYtUB"><a href="mailto:rachelbencosme@crazymaplestudio.com" rel="nofollow"><span class="Footer_item_sub_text__EQ_F8">Media &amp; Public Relations</span></a></div></div><div class="Footer_footer_item__Jzv7v"><div class="Footer_item_title__7csub">Download</div><div class="Footer_direction_vertical__AzlqL"><div class="Footer_icons__CM1hG"><div><div class="mt-12px text-center text-16px text-white/50 leading-[normal]">Unlock Episodes Free Only in APP</div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div></footer></div></div></main><div class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-[120px] right-[10px] z-[9999] hidden md:block h-[231px] w-[184px]"><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[231px] w-[184px] origin-bottom-right overflow-hidden rounded-8px bg-[#333333] transition-all duration-300 ease-out  px-12px pb-16px pt-12px border-1 border-white/15 pointer-events-auto translate-y-0 scale-100 opacity-100"><button type="button" aria-label="Close QR code" class="absolute right-12px top-12px h-16px w-16px cursor-pointer border-none bg-transparent p-0"><img src="https://v-mps.crazymaplestudios.com/images/df8b7de0-49c2-11f1-acb2-c14bef828c82.png" alt="" class="w-full"/></button><div class="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-between"><div class="text-white/90 font-bold">Download</div><div class="h-128px w-128px overflow-hidden rounded-8px bg-[#ffffff]"><div style="width:128px;height:128px;overflow:hidden"><canvas style="width:100%;height:100%;transform-origin:top left"></canvas></div></div><div class="text-center text-12px text-white font-bold leading-[normal]">Unlock Episodes Free Only in APP</div></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand QR code" class="absolute cursor-pointer bottom-0px right-0px h-48px w-48px flex-center rounded-4px border-1px border-solid border-white/15 bg-[#333333] transition-all duration-300 ease-out rounded-full pointer-events-none translate-y-[8px] scale-90 opacity-0"><img src="https://v-mps.crazymaplestudios.com/images/96129880-541a-11f1-b0e9-f1e04973cf14.png" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></button></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"tags":{"1001":[],"1005":[],"1020":[],"1022":[]},"tagId":"","category_id":"1000","tagBooks":{"desc":"","tag_id":"","category":"","tag_name":"","top_books":[],"recommend_tags":[{"tag_id":"676d210e4582b53a14081ac2","tag_name":"Police"},{"tag_id":"676d210e4582b53a14081a94","tag_name":"Chef"}],"books":[{"t_book_id":"200000000000000355","book_title":"We're Your Parents","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000355/9172d232-8da3-4e1f-8c61-325a7e486058.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"A college freshman comes home for her family's legendary Thanksgiving feast and starts to suspect there's something very wrong with her parents.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":11959764,"collect_count":194214,"chapter_count":27,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":8237,"init_read_count":211757,"book_id":"68e9aa284838ef5d700ef20a","chapter_id":"bbxjli84ai","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000272","book_title":"Regret is the Punishment","book_pic":"https://v-mps.crazymaplestudios.com/images/8ca5d420-0324-11f1-84ad-6b5693b490dc.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"In Regret is the Punishment movie, MC Karen is a stay at home mom, her husband Tom is a rich Lawyer. While Karen is out, her house catches on fire and their five year old daughter Anna falls to her death. \nGood samaritan Merry goes with the fire truck to take Anna to the hospital, driven by Bob, the fire captain. They need to take Anna to the ER for surgery as soon as possible.\nThe fire truck hits Karen's car, on her way back from cheating on her husband. She demands they grovel for forgiveness, then pay for damages, wasting their time. Merry and Eve, the paramedic, as well as kind passerbys, try to get her to move. Karen does not give in, not realizing the fire truck is trying to save her own daughter.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":29670154,"collect_count":427318,"chapter_count":30,"is_paid":1,"init_collect_count":9509,"init_read_count":198098,"book_id":"6836a4b02ef81742260a5219","chapter_id":"n2cdenanug","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000257","book_title":"The Adjuster","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000257/427c59f6-9b97-42a2-a4bc-2fd338b1d926.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"In The Adjuster movie, after his sister dies due to losing health coverage, Matteo Leone, a broken man, takes justice into his own hands by killing the insurance company CEO. But he isn't just out for revenge, he has a bigger goal: Expose corrupt health insurance companies for preying on their most vulnerable customers. Matteo stays one step ahead of the police, leaving a trail of clues to send his message, soon becoming a hero to the people the evil CEO's thought they could silence.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":14103844,"collect_count":176547,"chapter_count":38,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":9863,"init_read_count":240573,"book_id":"6825b32759426343470c833f","chapter_id":"l2h1t679ye","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000002919","book_title":"Now You Know Who I Am","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000002919/246ba742-51de-407f-bc76-14a2d5940afb.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"Elena is chair of the Cooper Group. She handed the company over to her husband, Dalton. Elena returns to board of directors after a 5-year absence, but no one at the company recognizes her anymore. Elena is met with a workplace full of gossip, bullying, and rumors. Many speculate that \"Dalton's wife\" is some old hag. Flora, Dalton's secretary, has repeatedly, unsuccessfully tried to seduce him. One day, Flora sees Dalton and Elena sharing affection, and believes Elena to be his mistress. Then, she finds out Elana is pregnant. Wanting to be Dalton's mistress herself, Flora sets her sights on tormenting Elena, and forcing her out of the picture.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":28532716,"collect_count":363725,"chapter_count":40,"is_paid":1,"init_collect_count":12041,"init_read_count":282655,"book_id":"695f17baf52a835e5306ca5c","chapter_id":"yp1thwifbx","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000279","book_title":"The Reckoning Takes Flight","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000279/6ffd6b6b-e47c-4500-81ad-afd7fceb6724.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"Eve takes a flight to Hawaii to attend her big brother's wedding, booking an extra-wide seat because of her broken leg in a cast. A nasty woman and her bratty son demand Eve switch seats with them. The kid trips because of turbulence, his mom demands the flight turn back and fights the pilots, forcing an emergency landing. The mom's sister, Clara, shows up to back her up. Clara accuses Eve of being her fiancée's mistress, not realizing that she's her fiancée's little sister. The wedding is canceled, and Clara is sent to jail.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":125127854,"collect_count":2938658,"chapter_count":41,"is_paid":1,"init_collect_count":8934,"init_read_count":178687,"book_id":"6858f98983761bd35a005ddd","chapter_id":"hlhi9bu74j","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000334","book_title":"Alpha Mate Unchained","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000334/baf06e97-c911-4700-b4f9-d6428f69d878.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"In Alpha Mate Unchained movie, he killed his vicious father to save her.  Now the new Alpha King must hide his fated mate and use a decoy fake Luna to keep her alive. But while he’s away battling, she’s discovered by the Fake Luna and brutally tortured.  Can she survive long enough for the Alpha King’s return and vengeance?","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":28599730,"collect_count":240256,"chapter_count":44,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":8527,"init_read_count":239527,"book_id":"68bb61123f9c8d053b0d83bc","chapter_id":"qc6u2m7m0i","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000003","book_title":"Do Me Over","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000003/7162fd94-75a0-4247-ab4c-deaa6acc7931.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"Sarah Loren is a widow with a teenage son, Ethan Cole is a big shot CEO who wants to acquire her company. He is arrogant, brilliant, and unnecessarily good looking, and he'll stop at nothing to get what he wants, and what he wants… is Sarah's heart.","read_count":29946748,"collect_count":406140,"chapter_count":45,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":358,"init_read_count":18240,"is_preview":0,"book_genre":1,"book_type":1,"book_id":"6397ddc3c94f6e46282ef803","chapter_id":"n98paa1w","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000019","book_title":"Marry Me, Mr. White","book_pic":"https://v-mps.crazymaplestudios.com/images/5ebeba40-6687-11ee-be48-d1e02de79efc.jpeg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"Rachel finds herself without a groom on her wedding day, only to realize that her soon-to-be husband is in bed with her own cousin! Refusing to become the laughing stock of town, Rachel decides to continue on with the wedding, there's just one little thing she needs to do… find a new groom!","is_preview":0,"read_count":21709689,"collect_count":201062,"chapter_count":46,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":291,"init_read_count":18599,"book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"book_id":"6523c9d6ec314c3c5528dac1","chapter_id":"hnhhevr9","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000007","book_title":"How My Boss Became My Hubby","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000007/db62b020-5f3b-48b6-bb9e-24579aa0f819.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"Allison Lang is the personal secretary of Lucas Ager, Forbes 30 under 30 and hot shot CEO of Ager Enterprises. To get her ex-boyfriend Kyle off her back, Allison texts him that she's now dating Lucas Ager, but what happens when a twist of fate happens and the entire company sees her text message?! Will Lucas Ager fire her… or will secrets from their past come to light?","read_count":34901342,"collect_count":471753,"chapter_count":47,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":264,"init_read_count":17901,"is_preview":0,"book_genre":1,"book_type":1,"book_id":"645ebd7915e1d702e965b8c5","chapter_id":"g3o0x4p4","serial_number":1},{"t_book_id":"200000000000000248","book_title":"I Am Bloody Mary","book_pic":"https://v-img.crazymaplestudios.com/v-images/book_cover_batch/200000000000000248/bd4e3ef7-e9b7-4ea0-b8d1-2000e0af5934.jpg","book_source":1,"special_desc":"In I Am Bloody Mary movie, Mare and her fiancé Nick may not have much money, but they have love. As a foster kid with no family of her own, Mare dreams of a wedding with Nick’s family by their side, but Nick is secretive about his estranged relatives. Then, unexpectedly, his mother arrives, warmly inviting Mare into the wealthy and mysterious Thornwood family. She even offers to host the wedding at their grand estate. But the morning of the ceremony, a horrifying discovery shatters Mare's dream, and she realizes she’s not walking into a happy-ever-after, but into a nightmare twisted by the Thornwood family’s dark history--one that might end up killing her.","book_type":1,"book_genre":1,"is_preview":0,"read_count":18239984,"collect_count":187136,"chapter_count":47,"is_paid":0,"init_collect_count":11189,"init_read_count":233109,"book_id":"6825b0364baea997900af476","chapter_id":"yz8rt4lpzx","serial_number